<file path="README.md">
# overForge Platform

A full-stack real-time collaborative coding platform with AI-powered interviews, assessments, and intelligent counter-questioning.

- **Frontend:** React, CodeMirror, WebRTC
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express, Socket.io
- **AI Module:** Python, LLMs
- **Code Execution:** Judge0 CE
- **Database:** PostgreSQL/MySQL

See [execution_guide.md](./execution_guide.md) for setup and usage instructions.
</file>

